Your Account Is Inactive

<%= if @reason == "default" do %>Your Firezone account "<%= @account.slug %>" (<%= @account.id %>) has no recorded activity and no setup beyond what was created at sign-up.<% else %>Your Firezone account "<%= @account.slug %>" (<%= @account.id %>) has had no recorded activity for at least 12 months.<% end %>

